\begin_inset Formula \[
\frac{\partial e_{xc}}{\partial\kappa_{pq}}\frac{\partial\kappa_{pq}}{\partial\varepsilon_{A}}=\left(\frac{\partial e_{xc}}{\partial\rho}\frac{\partial\rho}{\partial\kappa_{pq}}+\frac{\delta e_{xc}}{\partial\zeta}\frac{\partial\zeta}{\partial\kappa_{pq}}\right)\kappa_{A;pq}^{(1)}=\frac{\partial e_{xc}}{\partial\rho}\rho_{A}^{(1)}+2\frac{\delta e_{xc}}{\partial\zeta}\left(\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}\cdot\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{A}^{(1)}\right)\]

