= & \frac{\partial^{2}e_{xc}}{\partial\rho\partial\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\frac{1}{\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\rho^{B}\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}+\left[\frac{\partial^{2}e_{xc}}{\partial\left|\nabla\rho\right|^{2}}\frac{1}{\left|\nabla\rho\right|^{2}}-\frac{\partial e_{xc}}{\partial\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\frac{1}{\left|\nabla\rho\right|^{3}}\right]\left(\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}\cdot\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho^{B}\right)\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}+\frac{\partial e_{xc}}{\partial\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\frac{1}{2\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho^{B}\end{align*}

\end_inset 

Reformulating this using the terms returned by 
